  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Madini kwa amani na maendeleo/minerals for peace and development phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To encourage artisanal mining actors in South Kivu and Ituri to contribute to stability and community development in mining areas through conflict management and advocacy for improved security around targeted sites, through investment in physical, economic, and social infrastructure for mining communities, by encouraging communities to push for inclusiveness, greater transparency and accountability of authorities in their areas and by advocating at provincial, national, regional and international level for the respect of responsible supply chains of artisanally mined minerals</narrative>
  </description>
